	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: MOUNTING (FSAE 2027 EV.5.2.2, EV.7.5.2, EV.7.5.6)\n\n1. H1-H6: M3, 3.2 mm NPTH (no plating, no pad, no annular ring).\n2. Copper keep-out Ø <8> mm around each hole on ALL layers(M3 washer OD 7 mm + margin).\n3. No mounting holes inside the daisy-chain isolation zone. Holes outside the zone must still keep >= 4.0 mm to any cable-side copper (EV.7.5.7, 300-600 V, coated).\n4. Board GND = module negative = tractive-system potential. No connection to the chassis or any conductive surface (EV.7.5.2). Mount only with nylon screws, standoffs and washers.\n5. If the accumulator container is conductive, mount the board on an insulating plate or bracket rated >= max TS voltage and >= 90 °C (EV.5.2.2a, EV.7.2.1). Never mount directly to the container wall.\n6. Positively restrain the board and harnesses so spacing is kept under vibration (EV.7.5.6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 50.8 0)
		(size 83.82 32.0932)
		(margins 2.25 2.25 2.25 2.25)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 255 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7980c98a-3e70-4d2c-b4fa-5a03f5b3918c")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE: FIDUCIALS / LOGOS / MARKING\n\n1. FID1-FID3: 1.0 mm copper dot, 2.0 mm mask opening and keep-out, three non-collinear points near the board corners.\n2. Logos are silkscreen graphics only: set \"Exclude from BOM\" and \"Exclude from simulation\". Keep them off pads and vias, and out of the isolation zone.\n3. Mark the isolation zone on top AND bottom silk (boundary lines + \"ISOLATION ZONE\") per EV.7.5.6 / EV.7.5.7a.\n4. Board info text uses '$'{REVISION}' and '$'{ISSUE_DATE}' so the silkscreen always matches the schematic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 50.8 0)
		(size 76.2 25.1924)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87337efc-a142-4eec-bda9-88f214c666d0")
	)
	(text_box "FAB / ASSEMBLY NOTES\n\n1. <4>-layer, <1.6> mm FR-4 (Tg >= <150> °C), <1> oz outer /\n<1> oz inner.\n2. All vias under U1 tented or plugged, including the 36\nthermal-pad vias.\n3. Copper to board edge >= <0.5> mm on all layers. Coating thins at edges, so don't rely on it there.\n4. CONFORMAL COAT REQUIRED (EV.7.5.7 creepage depends on it):\n<acrylic / urethane / silicone>, rated >= 90 °C (EV.7.2.1), with UV tracer. Both sides; fully cover the isolation zone and U2/U3 pins. Mask J1-J3, test-point pads and mounting holes. Inspect coverage under UV before installation.\n5. Build one spare coated board (or keep photos) for technical inspection (EV.7.5.8).\n6. JP1 (LED enable) left OPEN for vehicle use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 81.28 0)
		(size 76.2 35.56)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
